[18.9316, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[2;87H\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[2m\n› \u001b(B\u001b[mYou are an independent discussion fork. Topic: commands.\u001b[K\u001b[4;87H  Use the source conversation as background; do not continue its unfinished actions.  \u001b[5;87H  Discuss the message below. Do not edit repository files unless the user later asks  \u001b[6;87H  you to implement changes.\u001b[K\u001b[7;87H\u001b[K\n  When the human is ready to finish, they can type /finish on its own in this pane.   \u001b[9;87H  The tmux adapter will notify the source thread and close this pane.\u001b[K\u001b[10;87H\u001b[K\n  Initial message for this fork:\u001b[K\u001b[12;87H  Discuss only commands for a minimal offline Todo CLI. Give a concise initial        \u001b[13;87H  proposal, then wait for human follow-up. Keep every response under 65 words and in  \u001b[14;87H  English. Do not implement, edit files, run tests, open forks, read private\u001b[K\u001b[15;87H  repositories/account details/personal memories, or make network requests. Leave     \u001b[16;87H  this pane open.\u001b[K\u001b[17;87H\u001b[K\n\u001b[K\n• \u001b[2mStarting MCP servers (4/5): codex_apps\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2m(2s • \u001b(B\u001b[m"]
