[33.5106, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[1m\u001b[2m\u001b[27;1H› \u001b(B\u001b[mYou are an independent discussion fork. Topic: local storage.\u001b[22X\r\n  Use the source conversation as background; do not continue its unfinished actions. \r\n  Discuss the message below. Do not edit repository files unless the user later asks \r\n  you to implement changes.\u001b[58X\u001b[31;85H\u001b[1K\r\n  When the human is ready to finish, they can type /finish on its own in this pane.  \r\n  The tmux adapter will notify the source thread and close this pane.\u001b[16X\u001b[34;85H\u001b[1K\r\n  Initial message for this fork:\u001b[53X\r\n  Discuss only local storage for a minimal offline Todo CLI. Give a concise initial  \r\n  proposal, then wait for human follow-up. Keep every response under 65 words and in \r\n  English. Do not implement, edit files, run tests, open forks, read private         \r\n  repositories/account details/personal memories, or make network requests. Leave    \r\n  this pane open.\u001b[68X\u001b[41;85H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\u001b[43;1H• \u001b(B\u001b[mStart with one JSON file in the OS user-data directory. Store a schema version and \r\n  tasks with stable IDs, text, and completion status.\u001b[32X\r\n  Save through a temporary file in the same directory, then rename it atomically.    \r\n  Lock during\u001b[72X\u001b[22;3H\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[38;5;39m──\u001b[83C┬\u001b[38;5;238m──\u001b[2;86H\u001b[38;5;39m│\u001b[3;86H│\u001b[4;86H│\u001b[5;86H│\u001b[6;86H│\u001b[7;86H│\u001b[8;86H│\u001b[9;86H│\u001b[10;86H│\u001b[11;86H│\u001b[12;86H│\u001b[13;86H│\u001b[14;86H│\u001b[15;86H│\u001b[16;86H│\u001b[17;86H│\u001b[18;86H│\u001b[19;86H│\u001b[20;86H│\u001b[21;86H│\u001b[22;86H│\u001b[23;86H│\u001b[24;86H│\u001b[25;86H│\r\n\u001b[38;5;238m──\u001b[83C\u001b[38;5;39m┼\u001b[38;5;238m──\u001b[27;86H│\u001b[28;86H│\u001b[29;86H│\u001b[30;86H│\u001b[31;86H│\u001b[32;86H│\u001b[33;86H│\u001b[34;86H│\u001b[35;86H│\u001b[36;86H│\u001b[37;8