[40.5416, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[1m\u001b[2m\u001b[27;87H› \u001b(B\u001b[mYou are an independent discussion fork. Topic: first-run experience.\u001b[K\u001b[28;87H  Use the source conversation as background; do not continue its unfinished actions.  \u001b[29;87H  Discuss the message below. Do not edit repository files unless the user later asks  \u001b[30;87H  you to implement changes.\u001b[K\u001b[31;87H\u001b[K\n  When the human is ready to finish, they can type /finish on its own in this pane.   \u001b[33;87H  The tmux adapter will notify the source thread and close this pane.\u001b[K\u001b[34;87H\u001b[K\n  Initial message for this fork:\u001b[K\u001b[36;87H  Discuss only first-run experience for a minimal offline Todo CLI. Give a concise    \u001b[37;87H  initial proposal, then wait for human follow-up. Keep every response under 65 words \u001b[38;87H  and in English. Do not implement, edit files, run tests, open forks, read private   \u001b[39;87H  repositories/account details/personal memories, or make network requests. Leave     \u001b[40;87H  this pane open.\u001b[K\u001b[41;87H\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u001b[2B• \u001b(B\u001b[mFirst run should work immediately, wi"]
