[62.5527, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[3;87H  • todo add \"Buy milk\" — create a task and show its ID.\u001b[K\u001b[4;87H  • todo list — show pending tasks; --all includes completed tasks.\u001b[K\u001b[5;87H  • todo done ID — complete a task.\u001b[K\u001b[6;87H  • todo remove ID — delete a task.\u001b[K\u001b[7;87H\u001b[K\n  Make bare todo show pending tasks. Use stable IDs and provide --help with examples. \u001b[2m\u001b[10;87H  Worked for 11s • 15:03                                                              \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[12;87H\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[2m\n› \u001b(B\u001b[mCan we keep the MVP to just three commands?\u001b[K\u001b[15;87H\u001b[K\u001b[2m\n• \u001b(B\u001b[mYes—use add, list, and done:\u001b[K\u001b[18;87H  • todo add \"Buy milk\" creates a task and returns its ID.\u001b[K\u001b[19;87H  • `todo\u001b[K\u001b[22;89H\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
