sage for this fork:\u001b[53X\u001b[54C  The tmux adapter will notify the source thread and close this pane.\u001b[K\u001b[70D\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n  Discuss only local storage for a minimal offline Todo CLI. Give a concise initial  \u001b[C\u001b[K\b\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n  proposal, then wait for human follow-up. Keep every response under 65 words and in \u001b[C  Initial message for this fork:\u001b[K\u001b[33D\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n  English. Do not implement, edit files, run tests, open forks, read private         \u001b[C  Discuss only first-run experience for a minimal offline Todo CLI. Give a concise    \u001b[34;86H\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n  repositories/account details/personal memories, or make network requests. Leave    \u001b[C  initial proposal, then wait for human follow-up. Keep every response under 65 words \u001b[35;86H\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n  this pane open.\u001b[68X\u001b[69C  and in English. Do not implement, edit files, run tests, open forks, read private   \u001b[36;86H\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[37;85H\u001b[1K\u001b[2C  repositories/account details/personal memories, or make network requests. Leave     \u001b[37;86H\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;85H\u001b[1K\u001b[2C  this pane open.\u001b[K\u001b[18D\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m\r\n• \u001b(B\u001b[mStart with one JSON file in the OS user-data directory. Store a schema version and \u001b[C\u001b[K\b\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n  tasks with stable IDs, text, and completion status.\u001b[32X\u001b[33C\u001b[K\b\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[41;85H\u001b[1K\u001b[2m\u001b[2C• \u001b(B\u001b[mFirst run should work immediately, with no account or setup wizard. Running todo    \u001b[41;86H\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n  Save through a temporary file in the same directory, then rename it atomically.    \u001b[C  shows an empty list and one example: todo add \"Buy milk\". Create storage only when  \u001b[42;86H\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n  Lock during updates to prevent concurrent writes. Missing storage means an empty   \u001b[C  the first task is added, then show its local path once. Keep help short and         \u001b[43;86H\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n  list; corrupted storage produces an error and remains untouched.\u001b[19X\u001b[20C  available through todo --help; avoid banners, sample tasks, and repeated onboarding.\u001b[44;86H\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[45;85H\u001b[1K\u001b[2C\u001b[K\b\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m\r\n  Worked for 22s • 15:03                                                             \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[2m\u001b[C  Worked for 24s • 15:03                                                              \u001b[46;86H\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[47;85H\u001b[1K\u001b[2C\u001b[K\b\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[48;85H\u001b[1K\u001b[2C\u001b[K\b\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[1m\r\n›\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2mAsk Codex to do anything\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[59X\u001b[1m\u001b[60C›\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[2mAsk Codex to do anything\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[27D\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[50;85H\u001b[1K\u001b[2C\u001b[K\b\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n  GPT-6.1-Sol xhigh · /private/tmp/codex-discussion-chat-demo-20261014/todo-cli · Ex…\u001b[C  GPT-6.1-Sol xhigh · /private/tmp/codex-discussion-chat-demo-20261014/todo-cli · Exp…\u001b[51;86H\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[1m←\u001b(B\u001b[m for agents · \u001b[1m?\u001b(B\u001b[m for shortcuts\u001b[53X\u001b[54C  \u001b[1m←\u001b(B\u001b[m for agents · \u001b[1m?\u001b(B\u001b[m for shortcuts\u001b[K\u001b[33D\u001b[38;5;238m│\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[22;3H"]
