[85.7672, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[2m\u001b[2;1H    local storage %8 open=True ready\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n    first-run experience %9 open=True ready\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n    + 1 line (⌃t to expand)                                                                                                                                                 \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[5;1H\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n• \u001b(B\u001b[mThree discussion panes are open and ready:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  • Commands: %7\u001b[K\r\n  • Local storage: %8\u001b[K\r\n  • First-run experience: %9\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  State saved in discussion.json (discussion.json). I’ll wait for your follow-up before collecting conclusions.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n  Worked for 1m 18s • 15:03                                                                                                                                                 \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[15;1H\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[2m\u001b[2B› \u001b(B\u001b[mCollect the conclusions, summarize the MVP plan, and close all discussion panes.\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u001b[20;1H• \u001b(B\u001b[mI’ll collect the three discussions, summarize the MVP plan, and close their panes.\u001b[K\u001b[1m\u001b[22;1H•\u001b(B\u001b[m "]
[85.7674, "o", "\u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m python3 scripts/discussions.py collect --state /private/tmp/codex-discussion-chat-demo-20261014/todo-cli/discussion.json --lines 120\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n  └   \"status\": \"open\",\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n      \"collection_file\": \"/private/tmp/codex-discussion-chat-demo-20261014/todo-cli/discussion.last-collection.json\"\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n    }\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n    + 51 lines (⌃t to expand)                                                                                                                                               \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[K\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m python3 - <<'PY' …\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n  └ State: /private/tmp/codex-discussion-chat-demo-20261014/todo-cli/discussion.json\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n    Status: closed\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n    Exit: 0\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n    + Show details                                                                                                                                                          \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[33;1H\u001b[K\u001b[1m\r\n•\u001b(B\u001b[m \u001b[1mRan\u001b(B\u001b[m tmux -S /private/tmp/codex-discussion-chat-demo-20261014/todo-cli.sock list-panes -F '#{pane_id} #{pane_current_command}'\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n  └ %0 node\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u001b[37;1H• \u001b(B\u001b[mThe MVP plan from the captured discussions:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mCommands:\u001b(B\u001b[m todo add \"Buy milk\", todo list, and todo done ID. Bare todo lists pending tasks; --all includes completed tasks. Deletion comes later.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mStorage:\u001b(B\u001b[m One versioned JSON file in the OS user-data directory, with stable IDs, text, and completion status. Use atomic saves and update locking; preserve corrupted   \u001b[42;1H    files and report an error.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  • \u001b[1mFirst run:\u001b(B\u001b[m No setup. Show an empty list with an add example. Create storage on the first add, show its path once, and keep --help concise.\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[49;3H\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[?25l\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[?25l\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h"]
